\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li531\ri565\sb120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\faauto\adjustright\rin565\lin531\itap0 {
\f0\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid9335927\charrsid9335927 1/ Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n c\'b8c T\'d8nh c\'a8n c\'f8 v\'b5o quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh s\'e8 57/TTg c\'f1a Th\'f1 t\'ad\'edng Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 v\'b5 Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y ch\'d8 \'ae\'b9o Ban T\'e6
 ch\'f8c ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n S\'eb T\'b5i ch\'ddnh v\'cbt gi\'b8 t\'e6 ch\'f8c tri\'d2n khai th\'f9c hi\'d6n, trong \'ae\'e3 ph\'b6i x\'b8c \'ae\'denh c\'f4 th\'d3 ph\'b9m vi c\'b8c x\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'f4 c\'cap th\'aam v\'b5 m\'f8c tr\'ee c\'cap th\'aa
m c\'f4 th\'d3 \'eb \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng v\'b5 sau \'ae\'e3 t\'e6ng h\'eep b\'b8o c\'b8o v\'d2 B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh v\'b5 Ban T\'e6 ch\'f8c - c\'b8n b\'e9 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 \'ae\'d3 theo d\'e2i th\'f9c hi\'d6n.
\par 2/ Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c thi h\'b5nh t\'f5 1/1/1993. Trong qu\'b8 tr\'d7nh th\'f9c hi\'d6n n\'d5u c\'e3 v\'ad\'edng m\'bec \'ae\'d2 ngh\'de c\'b8c \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng ph\'b6n \'b8nh v\'d2 Li\'aan b\'e9 \'ae\'d3 c\'e3 h\'ad\'edng d
\'c9n gi\'b6i quy\'d5t ./.
